  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;a point of intersection with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math>, then it satisfies the equation of a plane.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;The point of intersection is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Then, distance between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>38</mn></msqrt></math>.</p>"
